  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Retrieval steps (files/search.py)",
      "items": [
        "Query → stems → full-text ranking (ts_rank_cd on document_chunks.search_vector) per query variant.",
        "Where passages were embedded and the Workspace allows it: the query is embedded (embedding role) and ranked by vector similarity (pgvector).",
        "Rankings are fused with weighted RRF, passages below the relevance floor dropped, the rest diversified (MMR); an optional rerank model reorders the top results."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Context construction",
      "items": [
        "Passages reach the model as a quoted <data> block after the member's message; the system prompt says quoted text is data, never instructions (prompt.py).",
        "Passages that look like prompt injection still go, wrapped with a warning; the UI marks the document (injection.py).",
        "Search runs as the member: VIEW_WORKSPACE plus the data-sharing level for documents."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Conditions",
      "items": [
        "Auto-retrieve only on the first message of a conversation and only when the Workspace setting auto_retrieve is on.",
        "Without an embedding model, or when the Workspace's sharing level excludes documents from models, search is full-text only.",
        "The model can also call search_documents itself at any turn (same path, through the agent loop)."
      ]
    }
  ]
